# Black Widow comes down on turn 3 and connects on turn 5. Bot2 exiles a Forest and an Island off the top of its library
# before it reaches Lightning Bolt. Bot1 declines the +1/+1 counter, so the Bolt is Bot1's to cast this turn, and it
# pays the {R} with a Swamp (mana of any type can be spent) to bolt Bot2. The Bolt is Bot2's card, so it goes to Bot2's
# graveyard, on top of the two Mountains it discarded to hand size.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Black Widow, Super Spy
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x9
Forest
Island
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x5

